sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as Data Scientist<br/>(Notebook / Training Job)
    participant Registry as AlgorithmRegistry
    participant SFT as SFT Backend<br/>(instructlab-training)
    participant OSFT as OSFT Backend<br/>(mini-trainer)
    participant GRPO as GRPO Backend<br/>(ART + vLLM)
    participant GEPA as GEPA Backend<br/>(gepa + litellm)
    participant LLMAPI as LLM Inference API<br/>(OPENAI_API_BASE)
    participant MLflow as MLflow Tracking Server
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>(ckpt_output_dir)

    Note over Caller,FS: Flow 1: SFT / OSFT Training (Local Compute)
    Caller->>Registry: sft(model_path, dataset, hyperparams)
    Registry->>SFT: Delegate to InstructLab Backend
    SFT->>SFT: Execute training loop<br/>(torch, accelerate)
    SFT->>FS: Write model checkpoints
    SFT-->>Caller: Training complete

    Note over Caller,FS: Flow 2: GRPO Reinforcement Learning (Co-located vLLM)
    Caller->>Registry: lora_grpo(model, dataset, config)
    Registry->>GRPO: Delegate to ART Backend
    GRPO->>GRPO: Start co-located vLLM engine<br/>(in-process, no network)
    loop RL Training Iterations
        GRPO->>GRPO: Generate rollouts via vLLM
        GRPO->>GRPO: Compute rewards<br/>(tool-call verification)
        GRPO->>GRPO: Policy gradient update
    end
    GRPO->>FS: Write fine-tuned model
    GRPO-->>Caller: Training complete

    Note over Caller,FS: Flow 3: GEPA Prompt Optimization (Outbound LLM Calls)
    Caller->>Registry: gepa(task, config)
    Registry->>GEPA: Delegate to GEPA Backend
    loop Evolutionary Search Iterations
        GEPA->>LLMAPI: POST inference request<br/>Auth: OPENAI_API_KEY
        LLMAPI-->>GEPA: LLM response
        GEPA->>GEPA: Evaluate & evolve prompts
    end
    GEPA->>FS: Write optimized prompts

    Note over Caller,FS: Flow 3b: GEPA with MLflow Integration
    GEPA->>MLflow: Log experiment & register prompts<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    MLflow-->>GEPA: Prompt registry response
    GEPA-->>Caller: Optimization complete
